# QGEMM dimension-transform simplification inputs

The capture inputs in this directory are copies of measured captures in
`benchmark/mlir/`:

- `q80_q80_layout_trans_reshape.ttshared.mlir`
- `q80_q80_layout_reshape_trans_reshape.ttshared.mlir`
- `q40_q80_canonical.ttshared.mlir`

These three capture files are kept inside `buddy-mlir` so that its
dimension-transform lit tests run independently of the workspace-root
repository. `q80_one_candidate.mlir` is a self-contained canonical-form
fragment used by the forwarding test rather than a measured capture.
Regenerate the capture copies when the corresponding benchmark kernels or
their captured IR change.